cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use these data, please cite them as below, keep the HMRC Open Government Licence attribution for Import and Export Pulse figures, and acknowledge Eurostat as the source of China-EU Trade Pulse figures."
type: dataset
title: "Cambridge China Bridge open data: UK-China Import and Export Pulses, China-EU Trade Pulse and China holiday and factory-closure calendar"
abstract: "Quarterly summaries of UK imports from China and UK exports to China derived from HMRC Overseas Trade Statistics, a quarterly summary of imports from China into each EU member state derived from Eurostat Comext, and China's public holidays, make-up working days and estimated Chinese New Year factory closures from State Council notices."
authors:
  - name: "Cambridge China Bridge (Piggy Pineapple Ltd)"
    website: "https://camchinabridge.co.uk/"
    email: "enquiries@camchinabridge.co.uk"
version: "2026.10.1"
date-released: "2026-10-14"
url: "https://camchinabridge.co.uk/uk-china-import-pulse/"
license:
  - CC-BY-4.0
  - OGL-UK-3.0
keywords:
  - UK imports
  - UK exports
  - EU imports
  - Eurostat
  - China
  - HMRC
  - overseas trade statistics
  - Chinese public holidays
  - Chinese New Year
  - factory closures
